                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.516/293a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-06-04T19:00:00-04:00">June 4, 1934—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>41. Please cable present status of bank sales contract and proposed treaty.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
